<p style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C6D6E8">Retail and food service run side by side on the same business day. When you close, Merchtyl brings every register, cashier and payment into one End-of-Day report — ready to print or export as PDF or CSV.</p>
